WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
Practice alarm only.

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.575
Leave using a planned way out.

00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:09.438
If there is smoke, Ready.gov says get low and move under the smoke toward an exit.

00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:11.797
Feel the door before you open it.

00:00:11.797 --> 00:00:14.157
Get to the outside meeting place.

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:16.230
Do not wait only for a sound.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.803
Do not go back inside.

00:00:17.803 --> 00:00:20.520
This is not a tornado or flood action.
